claim.claim-text:
an image reception unit (301) configured to receive at least one of first image data, output from one or more image capture apparatuses (2), and second image data, output from another device (5), the first image data and the second image data to be subjected to an image-based determination operation;
a first play unit (304) configured to play and display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data received by the image reception unit (301), on a display (105);
a designation unit (309) configured to designate a detection area (570), to be subjected to the image-based determination operation, in a first display area (502) being displayed on the display (105), the first display area (502) configured to display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data; and
a determination unit (314) configured to perform the image-based determination operation on an image at the detection area (570) in a second display area (401) being displayed on the display (105), the second display area (401) configured to display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data.

one or more image capture apparatuses (2) configured to output first image data to be subjected to an image-based determination operation;
another device (5) configured to output second image data to be subjected to the image-based determination operation; and
an image-based determination apparatus (3) configured to perform the image-based determination operation on at least one of the first image data and the second image data, the image-based determination apparatus (3) including:

an image reception unit (301) configured to receive at least one of the first image data, output from the one or more image capture apparatuses (2), and the second image data, output from the another device (5);
a play unit (304) configured to play and display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data received by the image reception unit (301), on a display (105);
a designation unit (309) configured to designate a detection area (570), to be subjected to the image-based determination operation, in a first display area (502) being displayed on the display (105), the first display area (502) configured to display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data; and
a determination unit (314) configured to perform the image-based determination operation on an image at the detection area (570) in a second display area (401) being displayed on the display (105), the second display area (401) configured to display the at least one of the first image data and the second image data.
